<title>USA: PCA Int'l begins American Studios tender.</title>
<headline>PCA Int'l begins American Studios tender.</headline>
<dateline>MATTHEWS, N.C. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PCA International Inc said Friday that its ASI Acquisition Corp subsidiary has begun a tender offer of $2.50 cash per share for outstanding common shares of American Studios Inc.</p>
<p>The offer follows the previously announced merger agreement between PCA and American Studios.</p>
<p>The offer and withdrawal rights are scheduled to expire on January 22, the company said.</p>
